 "social": {
  "caption": "Three lines will get you through any konbini checkout.\n\n1. 温めますか (atatamemasu ka) = shall I heat it up? Answer: お願いします (onegai shimasu) = yes, please.\n2. 袋は要りますか (fukuro wa irimasu ka) = do you want a bag? Answer: 大丈夫です (daijoubu desu) = no thanks, I am fine.\n3. お箸をお付けしますか (ohashi o otsuke shimasu ka) = shall I add chopsticks? Answer: いらないです (iranai desu) = I do not need them.\n\nIf the clerk forgets to ask: 温めてください (atatamete kudasai) = please heat this.\n\nSave this for your next trip to Japan.",
  "hashtags": "#LearnJapanese #JapaneseTips #KonbiniJapanese #JapanTravel #JapanesePhrases"
